andscaping-construction-contractors-florida-01.jpg\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/luxury-landscaping-construction-contractors-florida-01-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/site/luxury-landscaping-construction-contractors-florida-01-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/site/luxury-landscaping-construction-contractors-florida-01-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/images/landscaping-1/luxury-landscaping-construction-contractors-florida-01.jpg 1250w\" class=\"image-gallery\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\"><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"w-json\">{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"/images/images/landscaping-1/luxury-landscaping-construction-contractors-florida-01.jpg\",\n      \"type\": \"image\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"group\": \"images\"\n}</script></a></div></div></div><div fs-slider-element=\"scrollbar\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_scrollbar\"><div fs-slider-element=\"scrollbar-drag\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_scrollbar_drag\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc3\" class=\"header-faq\"><h2>Landscaping Services FAQs</h2><div>Have questions about professional landscaping installation in North or South Florida? Our expert team answers the top questions from Florida homeowners.</div></div><div class=\"wrapper-faq-components\"><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do landscaping contractors use native Florida plants?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Our landscaping contractors prioritize native and Florida-Friendly plant selections that require less irrigation, resist local pests, and thrive without heavy chemical inputs. This approach delivers landscapes that look beautiful year-round while meaningfully reducing your long-term water consumption and maintenance requirements.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can professional landscaping increase home value?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Professional landscaping can increase Florida property values by up to 20% while delivering immediate improvements to curb appeal and livability. Thoughtfully designed landscapes with native plantings, clean hardscaping, and proper irrigation signal long-term investment — making a strong impression on neighbors, visitors, and future buyers.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can landscaping help reduce water usage in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Landscapes designed with drought-tolerant native plants, strategic mulching, and smart irrigation significantly reduce water consumption. Our team creates designs that meet local water restriction guidelines while maintaining a lush, well-maintained appearance year-round for homeowners across North and South Florida.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do you offer ongoing landscaping maintenance plans?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Our landscaping company offers maintenance plans covering trimming, fertilization, pest treatment, seasonal planting, and irrigation adjustments. Regular visits from our North and South Florida teams keep professionally installed landscapes looking pristine and thriving year-round without requiring homeowners to manage ongoing upkeep.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How do you handle salty soil in Florida landscapes?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">We select salt-tolerant, wind-resistant plants and improve soil drainage to ensure landscapes thrive near Florida's coast and inland areas. Combined with smart irrigation and professional hardscaping, this approach produces landscapes that remain lush, healthy, and visually polished throughout Florida's demanding growing seasons.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section></div><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>Regional Coverage With National Vision</p></div></div><div class=\"cms-country w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"cms-list-country w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-north-florida/service-areas-north-south-florida-pools.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Service areas map showing North Florida coverage for luxury custom pool builders and outdoor living services.\" class=\"full-image-background\" width=\"1250\" height=\"938\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7c8\" class=\"block-info-country\"><h3 class=\"white\">North Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in North Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered for structural integrity and long-term durability.</p><a href=\"/where-we-serve/north-florida\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">View North Florida Service Areas</a></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-south-florida/custom-inground-pool-builders-remodeling-florida.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Aerial drone view of a luxury custom pool and outdoor living projec